   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A level's node keeps its folder pattern; its specials branch to the right, each described; related/, studio/ and reports/ open into what they hold; the box under a node holds its definition, what shows on screen and its variants; the next level steps down and right. Red = open; green ✎ = changed.",
   "originalText": "A level's node keeps its folder pattern; its specials branch to the right, each described; related/, studio/ and reports/ open into what they hold; the box under a node holds its definition, what shows on screen and its variants; the next level steps down and right. Red = open; green ✎ = changed.",
